---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import SectionHeading from "@/components/SectionHeading.astro";
import AssetImage from "@/components/AssetImage.astro";
---

<Base title="Careers | Global Enterprise" description="Join Global Enterprise and help leaders make complex organizations easier to move forward." keywords={["Global Enterprise careers", "consulting careers", "strategy careers", "AI transformation careers"]}>
  <section class="bg-cobalt py-20 text-white md:py-28"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-end"><div><p class="eyebrow text-lime">Careers</p><h1 class="section-title mt-7 max-w-5xl">Bring your point of view to the hard stuff.</h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-white/75">We are building a small, serious team for work that sits between strategy, technology, and the reality of getting things done.</p></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink"><AssetImage src="/media/generated/education-future.avif" width={1536} height={1024} loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="Researchers and learners collaborating in a modern space" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover opacity-90" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-white"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Why here" title="High standards. Low theater." /><div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted"><p>You will work with people who care about the quality of the thinking and the usefulness of the result. We make room for clear writing, honest questions, and the kind of disagreement that makes the work better.</p><p>Our engagements touch enterprise operations, cloud architecture, AI and automation, public institutions, and the people systems that connect them.</p><p>We are always interested in meeting thoughtful operators, strategists, technologists, researchers, and leaders who want their work to travel beyond a slide deck.</p><a class="btn-dark mt-4" href="mailto:info@globalenterprise.com?subject=Working%20at%20Global%20Enterprise">Introduce yourself <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site"><SectionHeading eyebrow="How we work together" title="The team is part of the product." /><div class="mt-16 grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Outcome</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Own the outcome</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Be clear about what better looks like, then stay close to the people who need to feel it.</p></div><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Legibility</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Make it legible</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Good work should help the next person see what matters and what to do next.</p></div><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Curiosity</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Stay curious</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">The world changes. We keep learning, testing, and updating our point of view.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="The work you might do" title="The work is varied. The standard is not." /><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Frame the system</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Turn a complex mandate into a point of view a leadership team can use.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Make the decision real</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Connect policy, architecture, data, and workflow to the operating consequence.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Write for action</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Make the analysis clear enough that the next person can make a better choice.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Leave capability behind</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Help the client improve the system after the engagement, not depend on us forever.</p></div></div></div></section>
</Base>
